  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.065%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5108231948175064%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Total gross margin was 74% in the first nine months of 2026 as compared to 76% in the first nine months of 2025.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.508421052631579%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating income was $150.1 million in the first nine months of 2026 as compared to $181.3 million in the first nine months of 2025.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.508421052631579%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Other income, net was $30.0 million in the first nine months of 2026 as compared to $6.9 million in the first nine months of 2025, primarily due to a $28.9 million gain related to a UDC Ventures investment.</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.065%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5108231948175064%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The effective income tax rate was 20.1% in the first nine months of 2026 as compared to 19.4% in the first nine months of 2025. </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.508421052631579%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Net income was $164.3 million or $3.52 per diluted share in the first nine months of 2026 as compared to $175.7 million or $3.68 per diluted share in the first nine months of 2025. </font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:12pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Times New Roman;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.508421052631579%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Non-GAAP adjusted net income, which excludes the $28.9 million gain on the UDC Ventures investment and the related income tax expense, was $141.5 million or $3.04 per diluted share in the first nine months of 2026.</font></div></div></div>
